    Bug 2025857 - Move supported types/paths into separate files. r=babolivier


    This is pretty basic, but does what we need. The paths are hardcoded
    because the files are tracked in revision control anyway. Also
    supports comments and empty lines, in case structure ends up being
    useful.

    Also adds some better logging functionality.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D291313

